    "label": "15",
    "prompt": "Without using a calculator, evaluate:\n$$(123\\,456\\,785)\\times(123\\,456\\,782)-(123\\,456\\,783)\\times(123\\,456\\,784).$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$-2$.\n\nWrite the four consecutive integers in terms of one variable, expand the products and cancel like terms.",
      "worked": "Let $n=123\\,456\\,785$. The expression is $n(n-3)-(n-2)(n-1)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}n(n-3)-(n-2)(n-1)&=(n^2-3n)-(n^2-3n+2)\\\\n(n-3)-(n-2)(n-1)&=n^2-3n-n^2+3n-2\\\\n(n-3)-(n-2)(n-1)&=-2.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 40
  },
